This directory is a NuGet package source declared in ../../nuget.config.

It is normally empty: restore comes from nuget.org. It is kept in the repository
because NuGet fails an entire restore with NU1301 when a configured local source
does not exist, so a fresh clone could not build without it.

Locally it caches microsoft.ml.onnxruntime packages; those .nupkg files are
ignored by .gitignore.
